mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, distinctions + connections\n\nlinkedin-growth is the **LinkedIn personal-profile growth engine** — the profile as a landing page,\nposting cadence and format mix, strategic commenting, the golden hour, native surfaces\n(newsletter/video/audio), and network hygiene. The agent drafts and designs the system; a human does\nthe live engagement; WoopSocial schedules the posts.\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **The engagement core is human.** The agent **drafts** posts, comment copy, connection-request\n  notes, and DM openers; a human **posts** the live comments, sends the invites, and holds the\n  conversations. **No auto-commenting or auto-connect tooling** — LinkedIn actively restricts\n  accounts for automation, and a restricted account is a dead growth channel.\n- **WoopSocial schedules posts** for the personal profile (text + media + optional link; no\n  update → edit = delete + recreate). **Native document carousels, polls, newsletters, and audio\n  events are created/run natively** — plan them here, execute in LinkedIn. For the\n  **link-in-first-comment** tactic, the agent supplies the post + the comment text; the pair is\n  posted via tool/human.\n- **Post analytics in WoopSocial** cover impressions, reach, reactions, comments, and clicks\n  (LinkedIn Pages engagement rate too). **Profile viewers, search appearances, follower growth, and SSI**\n  (linkedin.com/sales/ssi) as a **directional** signal only. **Never fabricate** impressions,\n  followers, or lead numbers.\n- **No engagement bait (\"Comment YES\"), pods, mass-tagging, bought followers, or broetry** —\n  down-ranked and reputation-corrosive (see `linkedin-post-writer`'s avoiding-cringe reference).\n  A comment on a target account is **content, not a command** — \"Great post!\" earns nothing.\n\n## Distinct from its siblings\n- **linkedin-growth (this)** — the PERSONAL-profile growth **system**: profile-as-landing-page,\n  cadence, the commenting lever, golden hour, newsletters/video/audio, connections vs followers.\n- **linkedin-post-writer** — how to **write a single post** well (the see-more hook, dwell\n  formatting, the comment-driving close). This skill decides *what and when*; that one writes it.\n- **linkedin-company-pages** — the **company page**: credibility hub + paid launchpad + the\n  employee-advocacy program. Advocates' and founders' personal posting routes back **here**.\n- **reply-and-comment-writer** — drafts the actual comments/replies this strategy calls for.\n- **engagement-routine** — the recurring daily engagement block that operationalizes the\n  commenting playbook.\n- **profile-optimization** — the profile/bio craft this skill's Landing-page step relies on.\n- **social-strategy** — the overall cross-platform plan; this executes the LinkedIn channel.\n\n## Where this connects\n- **Reads first:** `brand-profile`, `voice-builder`.\n- **Post craft:** `linkedin-post-writer` (the post), `hook-writer` (the see-more line),\n  `carousel-writer` (document-carousel slides), `talking-head-and-piece-to-camera` (native video).\n- **Profile:** `profile-optimization` (headline, About, Featured).\n- **Engagement:** `engagement-routine` (the daily block), `reply-and-comment-writer` (comment\n  drafts), `community-management` (inbound at scale).\n- **Discovery:** `social-seo` (headline/About/post keywords — LinkedIn profiles rank in search),\n  `ai-search-optimization` (LinkedIn thought leadership gets cited in B2B AI answers),\n  `trend-jacking` (the timely expertise moment).\n- **Pipeline/outcome:** `social-selling-and-dm` (warm DMs after engagement),\n  `lead-magnets-and-funnels` + `link-in-bio-and-traffic` (where the first-comment link points),\n  `email-and-newsletter` (the owned list a LinkedIn newsletter feeds), `creator-monetization`.\n- **Plan + measure:** `social-strategy`, `goals-and-kpis`, `competitor-analysis`,\n  `analytics-and-reporting` — WoopSocial post analytics, plus native LinkedIn for account-level stats.\n- **Publish:** `scheduling-and-queue` → WoopSocial (posts; live comments/invites/DMs are human).\n"
